@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# RC31 — Prepared + Custom Notes
+
+- Based on RC30.
+- Restores a multiline Custom note field in the PDF notes editor.
+- Keeps the prepared AC/civil-work exclusions as a separate one-tap Prepared note action.
+- Applies the same notes controls in the Review/Edit notes sheet.
+- Custom Item remains disabled; materials still come from the catalog.
+- Keeps RC30 selectable Arabic/Kurdish PDF text-layer improvements.
+- versionCode 65 / versionName 5.0.0-rc31.
